  "je souhaite découvrir vos services": {en:"I would like to discover your services",fr:"je souhaite découvrir vos services",es:"me gustaría conocer sus servicios",de:"ich möchte Ihre Services kennenlernen",it:"vorrei scoprire i vostri servizi",nl:"ik wil graag uw diensten ontdekken",ru:"я хотел(а) бы узнать о ваших услугах",pt:"gostaria de conhecer os vossos serviços",ar:"أرغب في التعرف على خدماتكم",zh:"我想了解你们的服务"},
